{
  "counter duelist": "反击决斗者",
  "Every dodge blade and counter is an Answer she saves for one heavy Tidal Ribbon. Whoever she dodges or counters grows Weary and slows down, the way the rival fish always wore itself out. One pick keeps Fighting Current open to counter everything, the other brings it back fast; the signature makes the first strike always miss.": "每次闪避飞刃和反击都会积累回应，用于强化一次潮汐丝带。被她躲开或反击的敌人会疲惫减速。一种选择延长斗战水流的反击时机，另一种让它更快就绪。招牌天赋使首次符合条件的攻击落空。",
  "line piercer": "贯穿战线",
  "Her water Soaks every enemy it touches, and Soaked enemies take more of her magic and heal less. Tidal Ribbon sharpens on each enemy it cuts through, so long lines of enemies take the most. One pick breaks the first enemy on the line, the other the last; the signature runs the line to the edge of the field and back.": "水会浸湿敌人，使他们受到她更多魔法伤害，获得的治疗更少。潮汐丝带每斩过一名敌人便更锋利。一种选择重创线上第一名敌人，另一种重创最后一名。招牌天赋让斩击延伸到战场边缘，再沿原路返回。",
  "storm showpiece": "风暴表演者",
  "Her basic attacks and dodges fill her hands with Water, and at full her next skill is Brimming. Thousand-Fin Tempest Dazzles every enemy it strikes three times; a deep pick holds the wave longer or breaks it all at once. The signature is the storm with no walls, across the whole field.": "普攻与闪避会积攒水，积满时下一个技能会满溢。千鳍风暴会使被击中三次的敌人目眩。进阶天赋可以延长浪潮或让浪潮一次破开。招牌天赋让风暴覆盖整个战场。"
}
